(TMC)\\\",FontFamily->\\\"Georgia\\\",FontSlant->\\\"Italic\\\"]\>\"", ",", 
          RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            
            RowBox[{"\"\<1. Flexi\[OAcute]n + Abducci\[OAcute]n (fase \
